      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Chesapeake & Ohio Canal, a historic waterway once used for freight, runs near Leitersburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visithagerstown.com/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "History enthusiasts can visit nearby Civil War sites like Antietam and South Mountain from Leitersburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visithagerstown.com/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Leitersburg’s historic district features stone arch bridges and a pottery trail that showcase local craftsmanship.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
